{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51016","headline":"挽歌五首 其五 · 无名氏","name":"挽歌五首 其五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七载朝金殿，千秋遇圣君。\n九夷瞻北极，万国靡南熏。\n盛烈排轩后，崇淩压□文。\n灵知河泷士，兴断高乡云。\n（以上五诗从许国霖辑《敦煌杂录》录出。\n许氏拟页原作《进上挽歌》，此省作《挽歌》。\n）（三处改动皆从赵遂之说。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}